{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories","id":1441561,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Timelines Theories","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-03-26T15:39:45-07:00","id":1441561,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Timelines Theories","content":"So what are your theories on how Continuum exactly work how? Like, my own question - If in Adventure! Era are Daredevils, Mesmerists and Stalwarts - Why on Aberrant one are only Novas ( super Stalwarts) and on Aeon Era are only Psiads ( super Mesmerists)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T16:45:31-07:00","id":1441572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories#post1441561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what are your theories on how Continuum exactly work how? Like, my own question - If in Adventure! Era are Daredevils, Mesmerists and Stalwarts - Why on Aberrant one are only Novas ( super Stalwarts) and on Aeon Era are only Psiads ( super Mesmerists)?</div> </div> </div> </div>if I understand your question correctly it is answered in canon. Talents always exist (though their numbers increase when there are large energy spikes triggering Inspirations). Novas appear in large numbers the Aberrant era because of a huge Quantum burst that set of N-Day. Psiads and Latent Psions appear in large number in the Aeon era because of a Noetic energy burst that \u201csomeone\u201d released a Noetic wave healing corruption zones in 2104. In both cases the Novas and Psions respectively put out so much of their own energy type that the activations continued via energy exposure. The high rate of Nova eruptions only stopped because the Novas left.<br /> <br /> in the Adventure! era the Hammersmith event results in Stalwarts and Mesmerists, lower powered forms of the above. I would assume they don\u2019t put out energy the same way, or at least at the same level as Psiads/Psions and Novas, and so the Inspirations declined after the spike rather than building in a reinforcing loop.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-26-2021, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T16:48:35-07:00","id":1441574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories#post1441561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So what are your theories on how Continuum exactly work how? Like, my own question - If in Adventure! Era are Daredevils, Mesmerists and Stalwarts - Why on Aberrant one are only Novas ( super Stalwarts) and on Aeon Era are only Psiads ( super Mesmerists)?</div> </div> </div> </div>The premise of your question is flawed. There aren\u2019t only novas in the Aberrant era - Talents and psiads are there, and there aren\u2019t only psiads in Aeon - Talents and Aberrants are there.<br /> <br /> The answer to why the numbers are skewed is a better question. In general, there are more novas in the Aberrant era because there are more Quantum energies around that tend to trigger more novas. In the Aeon era, there\u2019s more noetic energy around which suppresses novas, but also lingering Corruption energies across the planet, which triggers Aberrants.<br /> <br /> Talents just keep happening regardless of the other energies around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 03-26-2021, 07:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T17:26:07-07:00","id":1441578,"title":"","content":"Well, the reason for having more psi users in Aeon era is the Prometheus chambers, other than that the number of Psiads is slightly higher, but not as high as Novas in Aberrant era. Psions in the other hand are many more than any other splat, because the trigger is controlled and granted when used in the right person.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T21:33:11-07:00","id":1441599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441578#post1441578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the reason for having more psi users in Aeon era is the Prometheus chambers, other than that the number of Psiads is slightly higher, but not as high as Novas in Aberrant era. Psions in the other hand are many more than any other splat, because the trigger is controlled and granted when used in the right person.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Adventure! preview seems to indicate that mesmerists using their psi powers directly on regular humans had a tiny chance of inspiring them into becoming new mesmerists. Did the Doyen somehow lock that potential out of psions, or can a psion accidentally - or even purposefully - turn someone into a psiad by using a power on them? This would seem to be especially likely for Vitakinetics and Telepaths, since their powers are meant to be used directly on people.<br /> <br /> Even if this side effect was somehow locked out of psions, it would still be a possibility for psiads. That would actually give psiads an interesting unspoken advantage over psions; the ability to make more psiads without technological intervention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T22:05:29-07:00","id":1441600,"title":"","content":"In thesis, high psi exposure would cause the character to become a Psiad, the same way as high quantum exposure would cause the character to become a Nova. But it\u2019s not that simple, and the effect seams to be more a possibility than a measured fact. I believe Psiads are more common in Aeon era, but not much more than usual, both because Bhurano experiment in 2104 and because of all the Psions spending psi around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T23:02:18-07:00","id":1441604,"title":"","content":"What is Psions vs Psiads difference in Aeon Era? Best would be to explain to me in Mesmerists terms...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T23:32:41-07:00","id":1441606,"title":"","content":"I do not like the <b>Aberran</b>t era general lore - much more I'm interested on <b><i>Climate Crisis</i></b> future. I also like general lore of all other eras - <b>Adventure!</b>, <b>TC Modern</b>, Anima and <b>Aeon</b>. Is there a way to bypass <b>Aberrant</b> and still end in <b>Anima</b> and <b>Aeon</b>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-27-2021, 06:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T00:15:26-07:00","id":1441615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441604#post1441604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is Psions vs Psiads difference in Aeon Era? Best would be to explain to me in Mesmerists terms...</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not going to explain in Mesmerist terms because I have no idea what you\u2019re talking about.<br /> <br /> Psiads are humanity\u2019s natural psionic evolution. They can gain mid-level dots in every Aptitude, and higher level in a few primary Aptitudes.<br /> <br /> Psions are genetically engineered from latent psionic humans who could never be psiads. They\u2019re essentially locked into one Aptitude but their focus and the genetic refinements mean they can reach the highest levels of power in this Aptitude.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T00:16:53-07:00","id":1441616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441606#post1441606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a way to bypass Aberrant and still end in Anima and Aeon?</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m sure there is, but you\u2019ll have to do the work on deciding how you get to a future building on super-being technology (Anima) followed by a future built on being weapons designed to fight the super beings (Aeon).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T02:19:16-07:00","id":1441620,"title":"","content":"What exactly you didn\u2019t like in Aberrant? That they are superheroes? That they become the villains? The idea of Quantum Powers?<br /> <br /> The answer have some impact on how you can replace Aberrant. The idea is, you need something that brought a global disaster and that can be literally fought against, otherwise Anima would have nothing to recover from, and Aeon would have no big enemy the Psions fight.<br /> <br /> You can replace Aberrants with aliens, but not a virus or a economical crisis. Not even a standard war can replace Aberrant war, because the enemy must leave humanity in peace but return latter (or the Psions would have no reason to exist).<br /> <br /> You can adapt further, but the amount of work to make it reasonable grows a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T03:06:50-07:00","id":1441624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441620#post1441620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What exactly you didn\u2019t like in Aberrant? That they are superheroes? That they become the villains? The idea of Quantum Powers?</div> </div> </div> </div><b>I do not like superheroes idea in 'realistic' setting</b>, per se. Classical superheroes points to me 'the individuals that rules the world', not 'saviors of humanity', more or less. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Quantum Powers are cool, on itself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Much more I like to see powers on lower end, like in <b>Adventure!</b> and <b>Trinity Core</b> they are described. When I want to play 'gods amongst humans' I have <b>Scion</b> for this one. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T03:10:02-07:00","id":1441625,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441620#post1441620\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not even a standard war can replace Aberrant war, because the enemy must leave humanity in peace but return latter (or the Psions would have no reason to exist).</div> </div> </div> </div>I still do not understand this one key points in <b>Continuum</b> - <b>if Novas are 'random occurrence' in humanity population, Aberrants cannot truly leave the Earth</b> - as long as there will be born Novas, there will be next Aberrant. Especially with 2E take that Aberrants are much more 'evil ideology' Novas, than mutated monsters. ( Even if they would also made as mutated monsters - as long as are Novas on Earth, they can mutates to Aberrants. ) \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T04:13:01-07:00","id":1441627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-anima/1385830-anima-what-are-we-expecting?p=1385844#post1385844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Though I have to admit to honestly hating the fact that they are keeping the Aberrant metaplot (really really don't like that). Especially there being the FSA, which I put in the big nope category. <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar661_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"661\" data-vbnamecard=\"661\">LordHeru</a> you maybe interested in our Aberrant discussion here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-27-2021, 07:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T06:53:17-07:00","id":1441636,"title":"","content":"Well, let\u2019s start.<br /> <br /> Novas try to become the rulers of the world, not all of them, but some, and that\u2019s basically what start Aberrant War. Not all novas are crazy or deformed by quantum powers, not all of them are cult leaders or space monsters, some are still pretty human. The issue is, the more power they are larger are the chances they have some level of corruption, and so larger are the chances they are crazy for power. Not all Novas are god like creatures, some retain pretty human in all aspects, maybe with a power that is not that potent, those have less chance to become real Aberrants.<br /> <br /> The term Aberrant is used to describe the subgroup in Terragen, but slowly become a slang to describe Novas that appear less humans and latter any Nova. By the time of the war (2060s) it\u2019s used as a synonym of Nova.<br /> <br /> Novas are random occurrences in human population, much like Psionic latency in Aeon, but FAR LESS common, not everyone can become a Nova, or a Psiad, or a Psion, no matter how much energy they receive, they need a genetic mark that can be triggered by certain conditions. When N-Day happened, it created an environment that increased the chances of eruption of Novas, and the presence of novas created an environment that increased the chances of eruption of Novas, creating a vicious circle. Novas can leave Earth, they just chose not to, until they are expelled in the end of Aberrant War. Well, some of them left earth before, some carried some humans with them, creating space colonies, some went in groups, some alone, but most of the novas were not powerful enough to live in space or even to leave Earth at all.<br /> <br /> The creatures Psions fight more often, are not real Aberrants, they are humans that were mutated by quantum powers or mere exposition to quantum. They are basically what happen when a normal person, that can\u2019t become a nova are exposed to high levels of quantum, they gain transformations and some advantages, but are hardly capable of energy manipulation, like a real nova. Those sub-aberrants increase the number of \u201caberrants\u201d around, because the real number of novas probably never reached the 30k (I play with a number around 15k on Aeon era, spread around the entire universe).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T08:34:49-07:00","id":1441644,"title":"","content":"So, if I get it correctly, in <b>Aeon</b> era, Novas are still on Earth more ore less the same as before. They only thing that changed, is that 'Aberrants' ( Quantum mutants, NOT Novas ) are banned for Earth. But still, if Nova is uncovered on Earth, it's banned as 'Aberrant' on just some false similarity to previous War, yes? So whole Aberrant War was only to expel those 'evil guys'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T09:20:39-07:00","id":1441654,"title":"","content":"No. All Novas were expelled (it doesn\u2019t mean the all leave, some are hidden, but their numbers are very low). And as the number of novas were reduced the eruption rate reduced, and after 2104 it dropped even more after a psychic wave reduced the general corruption level in the world.<br /> <br /> The war, even with some Novas fighting in humanity side, made all novas \u201cwar criminals\u201d and the ultimatum was used to expel all of them from Earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T12:20:33-07:00","id":1441672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441578#post1441578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the reason for having more psi users in Aeon era is the Prometheus chambers, other than that the number of Psiads is slightly higher, but not as high as Novas in Aberrant era. Psions in the other hand are many more than any other splat, because the trigger is controlled and granted when used in the right person.</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s more than that. The 2104 wave activated the Latents to become Psions. If you time traveled a Prometheus chamber back to the Aberrant era, you would not find many Latents who it could turn into Psions, because all that Quantum energy of the era is turning the would be \u201cLatents\u201d into Novas instead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-27-2021, 04:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T14:50:56-07:00","id":1441711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441644#post1441644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, if I get it correctly, in <b>Aeon</b> era, Novas are still on Earth more ore less the same as before. They only thing that changed, is that 'Aberrants' ( Quantum mutants, NOT Novas ) are banned for Earth. But still, if Nova is uncovered on Earth, it's banned as 'Aberrant' on just some false similarity to previous War, yes? So whole Aberrant War was only to expel those 'evil guys'?</div> </div> </div> </div>There are a few problems with novas on Earth in the Aeon era.<br /> <br /> 1). Because there are so few novas on Earth, most new novas will erupt within corruption zones, since those are the main places where they'd be exposed to intense quantum energies. Spending more than a few hours/days in a corruption zone will irreversibly turn them into aberrants.<br /> <br /> 2). Most if not all countries have an official kill on sight policy, and have devices that can detect nearby novas/aberrants. A newly erupted nova that doesn't want to die would probably wind up retreating to a corruption zone (and become an aberrant within hours/days) or repeatedly Maxing Out their powers, which generates Flux and slowly turns them into an aberrant.<br /> <br /> 3). People who hang out with novas are called aberrant cultists and persecuted everywhere, but hanging out with normal people is the quickest and easiest way novas have to shed Flux.<br /> <br /> tl;dr - the Aeon setting's politics and culture are pretty much designed to turn new novas into aberrants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T08:10:17-07:00","id":1441775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441644#post1441644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, if I get it correctly, in <b>Aeon</b> era, Novas are still on Earth more ore less the same as before. They only thing that changed, is that 'Aberrants' ( Quantum mutants, NOT Novas ) are banned for Earth. But still, if Nova is uncovered on Earth, it's banned as 'Aberrant' on just some false similarity to previous War, yes? So whole Aberrant War was only to expel those 'evil guys'?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nova eruptions are super rare in the Aeon era. They left after the China Ultimatum, and there is as such far less quantum energy on earth than in the Aberrant era, a point magnified by the Noetic wave in 2104. The exception is in Corruption Zones, but eruptions there tend to produce full Aberrants, not Aberrant-Era style starting Novas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T11:06:57-07:00","id":1441782,"title":"","content":"Nova erruption still is the Psiad equivalent even when its common its rarer than psions would be... now the processed equivalent seem to be even in Aeon time period fairly large in number.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T11:53:08-07:00","id":1441789,"title":"","content":"Its too bad that Eden didn't have a policy of monitoring Earth and rescuing newly formed Novas that are clean. That would be a cool setting element. <br /> <br /> Basically, if you want to be a pure clean nova in the Aeon era then you probably want to have an interstellar background. Because, for the reasons mentioned above, being a pure nova on Earth is mostly a death sentence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T12:05:57-07:00","id":1441791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441789#post1441789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its too bad that Eden didn't have a policy of monitoring Earth and rescuing newly formed Novas that are clean. That would be a cool setting element.<br /> <br /> Basically, if you want to be a pure clean nova in the Aeon era then you probably want to have an interstellar background. Because, for the reasons mentioned above, being a pure nova on Earth is mostly a death sentence.</div> </div> </div> </div>that could be something you can change in-game of course. Upeo wa Macho could start smuggling new eruptions who haven\u2019t done anything wrong to Eden for example, in hopes that eventual relations progress with Eden transitions to a more public amnesty policy in those cases.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-28-2021, 06:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T12:14:06-07:00","id":1441793,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441789#post1441789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its too bad that Eden didn't have a policy of monitoring Earth and rescuing newly formed Novas that are clean. That would be a cool setting element.<br /> <br /> Basically, if you want to be a pure clean nova in the Aeon era then you probably want to have an interstellar background. Because, for the reasons mentioned above, being a pure nova on Earth is mostly a death sentence.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or be Japanese.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T15:12:21-07:00","id":1441813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441793#post1441793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Or be Japanese.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, in canon not so much anymore. The last of the Nippon Novas died fighting Colony in 2105, and the Kaga-2/Nakamura program prevents new ones in favor of Superiors instead.<br /> <br /> I am curious if there will be any references to what is going on in Nippon at the time in Anima though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T16:50:08-07:00","id":1441828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441813#post1441813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am curious if there will be any references to what is going on in Nippon at the time in Anima though.</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be sad if they don\u2019t, but I believe they will bring something for sure, even if it\u2019s not the objective to have Japanese politics in the setting (they are closed for the last 40 years or so, they have some novas working for the government, there are a few superiors also working for the government, so everything is pretty much about politic).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T16:59:50-07:00","id":1441830,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441813#post1441813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> well, in canon not so much anymore. The last of the Nippon Novas died fighting Colony in 2105, and the Kaga-2/Nakamura program prevents new ones in favor of Superiors instead.<br /> <br /> I am curious if there will be any references to what is going on in Nippon at the time in Anima though.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Just like some Psiads slip through the cracks in a world of psions I would imagine its possible for a Nova to errupt in Nippon and not have issues given what they know. You might be the only one but that's what pcs are for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T17:44:59-07:00","id":1441834,"title":"","content":"That\u2019s true. There can be some Novas erupting in the abandoned areas of the archology.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T18:41:05-07:00","id":1441840,"title":"","content":"Possible but it requires the individual to avoid the Nippon government's mandatory vaccinations, so we are looking at essentially non-citizen squatters being the most likely group to erupt there. Far more likely for new novas to show up in Europe, the FSA or South America.<br /> <br /> Of course I'm inclined to play a little loose with the timeline in general. I really like the idea of 1st edition's (1922) Max Mercer going to TC Modern before bouncing to Adventure 2nd edition's setting, before encountering either versions of the Aeon or Aberrant eras. So there is still a missing Max out there, lost between the timelines of the Continuum, in that head canon.<br /> <br /> As far as why the original Hammersmith event didn't generate more of the 'bigger' templates, it wasn't a very concentrated blast of noetic or quantum energy. The 2nd edition preview out right says the device was supposed to draw energy from &quot;the space between spaces&quot;. While this sounds like an attempt to use <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zero-point_energy\" target=\"_blank\">zero point energy</a> if you don't know what it is, it tracks closer to the quantum flux mention in Trinity Core (Modern).<br /> Which will explain why Mesmerists and Stalwarts will likely run like modified Talents; in a sense, they are. Just leaning into some of the other universal forces, adapting those energies and possibilities to this one. They could have been Novas and Psiads, in another life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":".  Poor word choice 03-29-2021, 01:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T20:29:52-07:00","id":1441850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441840#post1441840\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Possible but it requires the individual to avoid the Nippon government's mandatory vaccinations, so we are looking at essentially homeless people being the most likely group to erupt there...</div> </div> </div> </div>There are people born and raised in the abandoned areas.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T22:22:35-07:00","id":1441858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441850#post1441850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are people born and raised in the abandoned areas.</div> </div> </div> </div>So homeless was not the best descriptor. Sorry.<br /> Unrecongised? Squatters?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:06:40-07:00","id":1441902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441858#post1441858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So homeless was not the best descriptor. Sorry.<br /> Unrecongised? Squatters?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am just saying according to the book the largest population growth in Nippon is in the white sectors and there's a Nova sleeping in Mt. Fuji. If you wanted justification for a relatively sane Nova on Earth Nippon is a good one.<br /> <br /> This doesn't make them not a rarity but that's what plot is about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:24:33-07:00","id":1441903,"title":"","content":"I think we got out of topic main idea - <b>How to make TC Modern -&gt; Anima -&gt; Aeon setting transitions without Aberrant era in it?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-29-2021, 10:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:25:01-07:00","id":1441904,"title":"","content":"Anyway, Ian said Mesmerists are Psiads and Stalwarts are Novas, they just are in a really low power level, so Mesmerists are not a mix between talents and Psiads and Stalwarts are not a mix between talents and Novas.<br /> <br /> A Mesmerist can train and become a full Psiad and a Stalwart can train and become a full Nova, they just need to learn how to do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:26:16-07:00","id":1441905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441904#post1441904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Mesmerist can train and become a full Psiad and a Stalwart can train and become a full Nova, they just need to learn how to do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>And Psions of <b>Aeon</b> are 'artificial' Psiads, super-Psiads, so too speak?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-29-2021, 10:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:33:59-07:00","id":1441906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441903#post1441903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we got out of topic main idea - <b>How to make TC Modern -&gt; Anima -&gt; Aeon setting transitions without Aberrant era?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>To go from modern to Anima, is simpler, you just need a world war or something as disastrous as that. If the internet falls, a new one would come back in a few years and take advantage of the higher tech, and after some time in a \u201csemi-post-apokaliptical\u201d setting people would go full anima trying to avoid reality in their free time.<br /> <br /> But Aeon is another issue, the existence of Psions and biotech is linked to the powerful enemies from the past that are returning. Aeon also require some unifying aspect to make the orders work together. I would suggest an alien invasion or the discover of an powerful enemy hiding in earth for millennia, a la Godzilla or Pacific Rim, but instead of using me has they start using Psionic powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T07:37:07-07:00","id":1441907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441905#post1441905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And Psions of <b>Aeon</b> are 'artificial' Psiads, super-Psiads, so too speak?</div> </div> </div> </div>Psions are people that have the capacity of retain Psionic energy in their bodies (called latents) that where genetically and noetically altered to become super focused Psiads. They can only develop one of the Aptitudes, and maybe 1 dot in any other mode, but they can reach levels of power regular Psiads can\u2019t.<br /> <br /> Also there is tens of thousands of them, while there are just a few hundred Psiads in the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T13:30:28-07:00","id":1441940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441903#post1441903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we got out of topic main idea - <b>How to make TC Modern -&gt; Anima -&gt; Aeon setting transitions without Aberrant era in it?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>There have been some good answers already for the middle part, but I think I've got a good explanation for the final part.<br /> <br /> Even without an Aberrant era, the Hammersmith event and Adventure! era would have happened. That means the Doyen still show up to stick Earth in a power dampening bubble. Have a Doyen investigator check up on the world in the aftermath of the Anima era and get ambushed by Dr. Bhurano and a small team of prepared psiads. If Divis Mal and Max Mercer knew about the Doyen, there is no reason she couldn't have found out about their existence as well.<br /> <br /> Incapacitating attacks and psi-tech restraining techniques coupled with telepathic interrogation would reveal that humanity is slated for eventual extermination due to our capacity to produce stalwarts. Digging for technical knowledge could reveal intel on how the Doyen once artificially empowered themselves, and this info could be used to similarly enhance humans, although limitations in the experimental technology would mean each prototype device would only empower one Aptitude, while mostly burning out the subject's capacity to develop other Aptitudes.<br /> <br /> Humanity is now prepping for a space war with the Doyen and the alien species under their control. This gives you Aeon with no Aberrant War.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T14:48:05-07:00","id":1441956,"title":"","content":"Actually, if Bhurano had known about the Doyen, the start of the \u00c6on era would have gone very differently. In particular, she would have made preparations to defend herself against them when her Event broke the Doyen-imposed shell; she wouldn't have been possessed by a Doyen and thus ended up as their unwilling mole in the Psi Orders; and her Psi Order may never have come into existence, as she may have been forced to go to ground to hide from the Doyen and had to work without a Prometheus Chamber.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T15:14:51-07:00","id":1441962,"title":"","content":"In the last comic in Aberrant (page 273) Mal is aware of the \u201calien cocoon smothering humanity\u2019s potential\u201d, and he know he shattered it in N-Day. I suppose they had communicated about this prior N-day, probably when they were still sharing information and studies.<br /> <br /> While it doesn\u2019t mean Bhurano was aware of the Doyen, she probably was aware of aliens and how powerful they can be. She probably were induced to go with the events that ended up in her possession, in Aeon last chapter it\u2019s said she had no choice to become a proxy, only the others had, so she probably was induced / dominated for some time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T16:47:02-07:00","id":1441972,"title":"","content":"I would think the logical out come of interacting with the Doyen and their Great fear of Novas... GIVEN there is no Nova Age nor Abberrant war go against it would be to try and spark a Nova age to defend humanity rather than say use the same tools the enemy has had thousands of years to perfect.<br /> <br /> If I wanted to have No Nova Age I'd probably lean more heavily into the space Opera aspects of Aeon and have a Quantum Race to the Doyen's psi so you can have the whole Vorlon/Shadows elder Races trying to prove the superiority of their power type with humans still being backstabbed for the potential for other options.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T21:32:05-07:00","id":1442005,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441956#post1441956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, if Bhurano had known about the Doyen, the start of the \u00c6on era would have gone very differently.</div> </div> </div> </div>She probably didn't know in the default setting, but that doesn't mean she couldn't find out over a century+ of alternate history. If the Nova Age never happened, maybe it is because the Doyen killed Dr. Primoris before he could become Divis Mal. Either Dr. Bhurano learns of them while investigating his death or Max Mercer tells her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T21:37:55-07:00","id":1442006,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441962#post1441962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the last comic in Aberrant (page 273) Mal is aware of the \u201calien cocoon smothering humanity\u2019s potential\u201d, and he know he shattered it in N-Day.</div> </div> </div> </div>We don't actually know that. While it would make sense for the cocoon to break as a result of Divis Mal's quantum burst, the Doyen apparently didn't notice the Nova Age, Aberrant War, or Aberrant diaspora across the galaxy/universe. If they'd known, they'd have done everything in their power to stop it and kill humanity on the spot. They instead didn't show up until after Dr. Bhurano's noetic burst, at which point they needed to empower human psions in order to destroy the quantum users who'd left Earth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-29T21:47:21-07:00","id":1442007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441972#post1441972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would think the logical out come of interacting with the Doyen and their Great fear of Novas... GIVEN there is no Nova Age nor Abberrant war go against it would be to try and spark a Nova age to defend humanity rather than say use the same tools the enemy has had thousands of years to perfect.</div> </div> </div> </div>Without a Nova Age or Aberrant War, most of what humans know of quantum powers comes from stalwarts, whose powers are almost entirely internal, a handful of anomalies with externalized quantum powers, and whatever they can learn about quantum using species from a captured Doyen.<br /> <br /> This isn't nearly enough to oppose the Doyen, especially as they'd lack the necessary knowledge to reliably empower or train people as novas. The Doyen have advanced noetic tech and Dr. Bhurano has spent two hundred years mastering her noetic powers, so it makes more sense to identify and empower psions than to try inventing a quantum empowerment chamber, which would likely be a much, much harder for a psiad to create.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T10:25:30-07:00","id":1442051,"title":"","content":"Okay, so...<br /> 1. Dr. Primoris become terrorist Davis Mal in Aberrnat Age canon?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> 2. Doyen are Psiad alien race that want to conquare the Earth?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1441972#post1441972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I wanted to have No Nova Age I'd probably lean more heavily into the space Opera aspects of Aeon and have a Quantum Race to the Doyen's psi so you can have the whole Vorlon/Shadows elder Races trying to prove the superiority of their power type with humans still being backstabbed for the potential for other options.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting take on...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T10:35:09-07:00","id":1442053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1442007#post1442007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Without a Nova Age or Aberrant War, most of what humans know of quantum powers comes from stalwarts, whose powers are almost entirely internal, a handful of anomalies with externalized quantum powers, and whatever they can learn about quantum using species from a captured Doyen.<br /> <br /> This isn't nearly enough to oppose the Doyen, especially as they'd lack the necessary knowledge to reliably empower or train people as novas. The Doyen have advanced noetic tech and Dr. Bhurano has spent two hundred years mastering her noetic powers, so it makes more sense to identify and empower psions than to try inventing a quantum empowerment chamber, which would likely be a much, much harder for a psiad to create.</div> </div> </div> </div>And using Psionics to fight the Doyen isn't a good plan either. Yeah she's had 200 years to study it, they have had longer than humans have had tools to master Noetics. The one unique thing she has as psiad that no Doyen has been before is... QK. Which could probably be used to at least get someone to superior levels.<br /> <br /> But honestly Aeon requires alot of changing to get to without the NOVA age. The politics of it all make no sense without an appocalyptic event. SInce you'd have to change around so much at that point adding more players on the &quot;Elder race&quot; scale is probably not that big a deal.<br /> <br /> Hell maybe that's how you get superiors in the setting? Psions are the Doyen offering. Superiors are the &quot;Shadows&quot; offering with the occasional true erruption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T10:56:29-07:00","id":1442055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1442051#post1442051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, so...<br /> 1. Dr. Primoris become terrorist Davis Mal in Aberrnat Age canon?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> 2. Doyen are Psiad alien race that want to conquare the Earth?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Interesting take on...</div> </div> </div> </div>1 Yes. He is not really a terrorist, he is more like a nova supremacist philosopher that says Novas are superior to humans and should not be bounded by human laws, so they can train and evolve to become living gods. That\u2019s horrible but not actively terrorism, but the real terrorists got this philosophy and read that as \u201cnovas don\u2019t need to respect human laws neither human life\u201d and start to kill humans.<br /> 2 Doyens are creatures that are made of pure plasma and noetic energy. They are virtually immortal, but quantum can damage and kill them. So they are extremely afraid of creatures capable of quantum manipulation and systematically kill all races that are capable of using quantum. But the novas are too powerful and grew in power too fast, so they could not kill humanity fast enough, and with Novas spreading all over the universe, the Doyen decided to use humans to kill the Novas, creating the Psions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 03-30-2021, 02:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T11:52:22-07:00","id":1442060,"title":"","content":"I would not call him a terrorist. He wss more a philosopher who wrote about nova differences from baselines. But he didn't blow up buildings or kill people in shops or any such thing. <br /> <br /> In fact at the very end he killed the Secretary-General and then made everyone leave. <br /> <br /> Now I'm not saying he is all gumdrops and roses but he isn't evil. <br /> <br /> Which is why I hope we don't see him go all Nazi-like. It would be dissapointing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T14:14:44-07:00","id":1442081,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1442051#post1442051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, so...<br /> 1. Dr. Primoris become terrorist Davis Mal in Aberrnat Age canon?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>As of the setting &quot;now&quot; of Aberrant, the only thing Mal is known by the public to have done is issue the Null Manifesto which leads to the formation of Teragen. Teragen does have a militant wing who governments do label as terrorist (&quot;Aberrant&quot; in 2E, was &quot;Nova Vigilance&quot; in 1E), but they are not all of Teragen, nor is Mal giving them orders, he just defined the philosophy of Teras.<br /> <br /> That's as of &quot;now&quot; in the setting of course. Mal will be an active leading enemy of baseline humanity if the timeline continues as in the canon past of Aeon, and the UN ends up going to war on Novas. But if you're playing Aberrant, player characters can potentially change that future.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2. Doyen are Psiad alien race that want to conquare the Earth?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div>No. Conquest of a single dot in the cosmos does not interest the Doyen. As beings of Psi energy and and plasma, they have no need for a planetary home or natural resources. But as beings of Psi, they can be killed by Quantum energy. They divide into two camps - those who see humanity's Psi potential as a resource to be weaponized against the Aberrants; and those who see humanity (due to their potential for Eruption and for Quantakinesis) as too fundamentally dangerous to be allowed to live.<br /> <br /> <br /> (if the impression you get from that reveal is that the Doyen, and not Aberrants, are the real big bads of the Aeon setting, and the various species and factions of humanity fighting each other should unify against the Doyen - congratulations you solved Aeon)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-30-2021, 05:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T16:49:40-07:00","id":1442104,"title":"","content":"<b>RE: Aberrant</b><br /> <br /> I will play the devil's advocate and say don't shut the door on the Nova Era quite yet. In 1st edition (a bit less so in 2nd), Aberrant was strongly deconstructionist - the directly looked at and challenged the idea that people with these amazing powers would be compelled to be saviors. Most the time, they were regular folks granted unbelievable power by essentially luck of the draw. In Scion there is a mythic element, an idea that your character is special, and has a special destiny. In Aberrant,those godlike powers are given to people with all the hopes, dreams, flaws, and biases of any other person, and their only destiny is what they can carve out. You speak of people with that kind of power ruling the world, and that is <i>exactly</i> what many of the big geopolitical powers are afraid of!<br /> <br /> If you can, get a actually copy of one of the editions and give it a solid read, there is way more going on than traditional 4-color super hero tropes.<br /> <br /> And if you still can't make it work, at least cherry pick it for cool ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1420009-the-artificer-s-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">The Artificer's Workshop</a> - A collection of Exalted Artifacts<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806809-curios-relics-and-tomes\" target=\"_blank\">Curios, Relics, and Tomes</a> - A collection of Relics (Cursed and Otherwise)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/793173-the-horror-show\" target=\"_blank\">The Horror Lab</a> - A collection of Beasts, Monsters and less definable things.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1128197-strange-places#post1128197\" target=\"_blank\">Strange Places</a> - A collection of Dark, Mysterious, and Wondrous Locations<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993181-twilight-menagerie\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Menagerie</a> - A collection of Ephemeral Entities","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell","name":"Reighnhell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"749"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-30T20:28:27-07:00","id":1442127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1442081#post1442081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(if the impression you get from that reveal is that the Doyen, and not Aberrants, are the real big bads of the Aeon setting, and the various species and factions of humanity fighting each other should unify against the Doyen - congratulations you solved Aeon)</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, with that reveal/spoiler to me - <b>Can we make Continuum with Doyen, but withouts Aberrant era as canon?</b> What IS interesting for me in <b>Aeon</b> is <i>trying</i> to make coherent, idealistic World Government - but they STILL cannot make it. ( So, like a early setting of <b>Star Trek</b>, before true First Contact in 2063 year of Trek. ) I was hoping for the Climate Crisis to be this push for <b>Aeon</b>, but seeing how it works in the Real Life, yes, I can imagine it still would not be enough for humanity to unite. Dying planet in lllllooonnnggg death is not enough for us to rethink society... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> More thinking to that - Even <b>Star Trek</b> become United Earth AFTER <a href=\"https://memory-alpha.fandom.com/wiki/First_contact#Human-Vulcan_first_contact\" target=\"_blank\">First Contact with Volcans</a>. So First Contact maybe needed shake for humanity to throw down ideas of nation states... However First Contact can be...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-30-2021, 11:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-31T01:58:59-07:00","id":1442155,"title":"","content":"Aexpansion (Aeon Companion) has many suggestions on how to bring the psions to modern world, from \u201cpsions are the new humans\u201d to \u201cpsions were created by alien machines abandoned on earth long ago\u201d.<br /> <br /> We can use some of those ideas to make it, but it change a lot the dynamics in Aeon, from the reason psions become public to the reason psions exist and the general public opinion about them.<br /> <br /> The doyen also change function, from the behind the scene benefactor that has second intentions, to the behind the scene reason for aliens coming to attack Earth or even the behind the scene reason for being so hard to find aliens around (all these are the doyen in Aeon, with different levels of importance).<br /> <br /> I will bring the question back to you @wyrdhammster , make your narrative to get Aeon without Aberrants and maybe we can give some ideas on how it could work. <br /> Where the psions come from? Are they natural or engineered? Who engineered them? Why? If natural, why the different altitudes? Are they regional? Ethnic? Trained by the orders? Maybe it\u2019s just marginally engineered with the orders grabbing psiads and adding hormones/genetic therapy to turn them into psions, I don\u2019t know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-31T08:49:08-07:00","id":1442178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Reighnhell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1441561-trinity-continuum-timelines-theories?p=1442104#post1442104\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>RE: Aberrant</b><br /> <br /> I will play the devil's advocate and say don't shut the door on the Nova Era quite yet. In 1st edition (a bit less so in 2nd), Aberrant was strongly deconstructionist - the directly looked at and challenged the idea that people with these amazing powers would be compelled to be saviors. Most the time, they were regular folks granted unbelievable power by essentially luck of the draw. In Scion there is a mythic element, an idea that your character is special, and has a special destiny. In Aberrant,those godlike powers are given to people with all the hopes, dreams, flaws, and biases of any other person, and their only destiny is what they can carve out. You speak of people with that kind of power ruling the world, and that is <i>exactly</i> what many of the big geopolitical powers are afraid of!<br /> <br /> If you can, get a actually copy of one of the editions and give it a solid read, there is way more going on than traditional 4-color super hero tropes.<br /> <br /> And if you still can't make it work, at least cherry pick it for cool ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, you don't actually need the aberrant era in order to get to the aeon era. All you need is the aberrant war. That is, you can skip over the hero worship stage where novas are adored and idolized, and go straight to the stage where baselines are at war with the superhumans.<br /> <br /> Now, if your goal is to take superhumans out of the timeline entirely, that makes things a lot harder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}